  "description": "Cross-site content teasers for Umbraco 17 & 18. Lets a site pull content teasers (cases, articles, and other configurable doc types) from another Umbraco site over HTTP and render them as listing cards that link out to the source site. Ships a backoffice picker, a stale-while-revalidate teaser cache, and a key-gated producer endpoint; each site points CrossContent:BaseUrl/ApiKey at the site it wants to read.",
